sentences.text:
The above writ petition is filed with the following prayers:
"(i). call for the records connecting Exhibit P26 order dated 7/5/2025 issued by the 2nd respondent and quash Exhibit P26 by issuing a Writ of Certiorari or any other appropriate Writ, Order or Direction;
(ii). issue a Writ of Mandamus or any other appropriate Writ, Order or Direction,
directing the 2nd respondent to issue paper form of Trade License to the petitioner in view of pendency of Exhibit P-9 Application, in terms of Section 447(6) of the Kerala Municipalities Act and renew the same for the subsequent years, within a time frame fixed by this Hon'ble Court ;
